{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another end of the world - since it is the SCP universe, you should not be surprised. This time, almost all living forms are destroyed. Some turned into holograms - aggressive and dangerous entities that will try to kill everyone who passes by. The only surviving remains are, of course, the SCP bunker with a small group of people. <br>In this FPS, you are playing as one of the last Foundation soldiers. Your task is simple - retrieve documents that will help your scientists create a portal out of this world. To get these papers, you will need to go through desert-like fields, an abandoned city, and empty corridors of the Site-17. <br>Supplies are running out pretty fast, so you will have to keep an eye on them and always search remaining stashes across your path. Ammo, medkits, pills - all of that will help you survive and complete the mission.<br>Do not underestimate holograms - they can be shot from your rifle, but if you hesitate for a small amount of seconds, they will teleport right before your face and kill you within seconds.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3635310?t=1770059022","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3635310?t=1770059022","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635310/b61a3f3f9960521e21701bb49f49fb0628f68ad5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770059022","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635310/b61a3f3f9960521e21701bb49f49fb0628f68ad5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770059022","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another end of the world - since it is the SCP universe, you should not be surprised. This time, almost all living forms are destroyed. Some turned into holograms - aggressive and dangerous entities that will try to kill everyone who passes by. The only surviving remains are, of course, the SCP bunker with a small group of people. <br>In this FPS, you are playing as one of the last Foundation soldiers. Your task is simple - retrieve documents that will help your scientists create a portal out of this world. To get these papers, you will need to go through desert-like fields, an abandoned city, and empty corridors of the Site-17. <br>Supplies are running out pretty fast, so you will have to keep an eye on them and always search remaining stashes across your path. Ammo, medkits, pills - all of that will help you survive and complete the mission.<br>Do not underestimate holograms - they can be shot from your rifle, but if you hesitate for a small amount of seconds, they will teleport right before your face and kill you within seconds.</p>","developers":["10th Emerald Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635310/48310142860063bc7ff44c8b5daf94a6a46181dd/header.jpg?t=1770059022","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"SCP: Short Story","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen R5 1400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8192 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RX 560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["10th Emerald Studio"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"16","rating